        "raw_markdown": "[hypothetical question] what would happen if i select a notebook which was submitted using H100 for my final submission at the end of the deadline? will it automatically reverted to RTX6000 or will i get scoring error??",
        "content": "<p>[hypothetical question] what would happen if i select a notebook which was submitted using H100 for my final submission at the end of the deadline? will it automatically reverted to RTX6000 or will i get scoring error??</p>",
