            "id": 3523011,
            "post_date": "2026-09-10T09:45:20.483Z",
            "raw_markdown": "There are no rerun at end of competition. Your final score is already computed but will stay hidden till end of competition.\n\nThere are 100 game sin test data. 55 are used to compute the score shown on public LB during the competition. 55 are used to compute a hidden score that will be used for final ranking if you select that submission.",
            "content": "<p>There are no rerun at end of competition. Your final score is already computed but will stay hidden till end of competition.</p>\n<p>There are 100 game sin test data. 55 are used to compute the score shown on public LB during the competition. 55 are used to compute a hidden score that will be used for final ranking if you select that submission.</p>",
