      "id": 3454787,
      "post_date": "2026-05-07T22:16:59.523Z",
      "raw_markdown": "Hi all, \nGiven the change in accelerators from H100s to RTX 6000, and because we want to make sure your models still have ample resource headroom to run successfully on the new hardware, we have adjusted the code requirements and extended the maximum notebook runtime. It has increased from 6 hours to 9 hours. I noted this on the Overview tab, in the section [Code requirements](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/code-requirements). \n\nThank you everyone for your patience as we worked through this challenge. \n\nHappy modeling, and good luck!\n\nMaría",
      "content": "<p>Hi all, \nGiven the change in accelerators from H100s to RTX 6000, and because we want to make sure your models still have ample resource headroom to run successfully on the new hardware, we have adjusted the code requirements and extended the maximum notebook runtime. It has increased from 6 hours to 9 hours. I noted this on the Overview tab, in the section <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2026-arc-agi-3/overview/code-requirements\" target=\"_blank\">Code requirements</a>. </p>\n<p>Thank you everyone for your patience as we worked through this challenge. </p>\n<p>Happy modeling, and good luck!</p>\n<p>María</p>",
      "parent": {},
